<title>UK: London gold fixes easier, rest of complex firmer.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes easier, rest of complex firmer.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $325.30 vs $326.35 previously. Quiet so far with some  physical demand. Offtake being limited by strong dollar. May edge  lower after weakish close.</p>
<p>SILVER - Holding firmer levels at $4.48/$4.50 up eight cents.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Firmer at $435.00/$438.00, up $8.50.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Sharply higher at $223.00/$226.00 up $18.00. Short</p>
<p>covering on Tocom, Impala strike threat supportive.</p>
</text>
